### 카테고리 추가
POST http://localhost:8080/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name" : "회의실",
  "itemType": "room"
}

### 회의실 추가
POST http://localhost:8080/items/room
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "회의실 D",
  "description": "중형 회의실",
  "status": "available",
  "category": "6720d2582ba282d39d8a4e8a",
  "capacity": 5,
  "location": "10층"
}

